      "rendered": "<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3186\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/02/07/stainless-steel-cable-001/material_710/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_710.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_710\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_710.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3186\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_710.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"free seamless pbr steel cable texture\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3186\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/02/07/stainless-steel-cable-001/material_710/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_710.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_710\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_710.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3186 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"free seamless pbr steel cable texture\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_710.png\"></p>\n<p><noscript><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3187\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/02/07/stainless-steel-cable-001/material_711/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_711.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_711\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_711.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3187\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_711.png?resize=600%2C800&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"Material_711.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\"></noscript><img decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"3187\" data-permalink=\"https://3dtextures.me/2019/02/07/stainless-steel-cable-001/material_711/\" data-orig-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_711.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"600,800\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Material_711\" data-image-description data-image-caption data-large-file=\"https://i0.wp.com/3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_711.png?fit=600%2C800&amp;ssl=1\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3187 lazyload\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%20600%20800%22%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E\" alt=\"Material_711.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"800\" data-src=\"https://3dtextures.me/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/material_711.png\"></p>\n<h2>Stainless Steel Cable 001 – Free seamless texture, 1024&nbsp;x 1024, with the following maps:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Diffuse</li>\n<li>Normal</li>\n<li>Displacement</li>\n<li>Roughness</li>\n<li>Ambient Occlusion</li>\n<li>Metallic</li>\n</ul>\n<p><!--more--></p>\n<blockquote><p><strong>For Tier 3 Patrons, there&#8217;s a 4K resolution uncompressed PNG version of this texture. There&#8217;s also a SBS and a SBSAR files (<a href=\"http://3dtextures.me/what-are-sbs-sbsar-files/\">what are these?</a>) for texture customization.</strong></p></blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1FW7EdW-DItU-Rzpiq39Ok6njXSvUpFF7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><noscript><img data-recalc-dim